{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"6116b6aac6333d9c33f6a0e0d4d43fcbea7ef0029a96bf0badec6f3b66274851","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_adc2684206a7b4919692f2ccf0ff6fbfc0229e8a0e07ea1ef3585aa65f1bd3d2","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical contribution to model-based reinforcement learning with limited discussion of policy, compliance, or ethical considerations. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine specific privacy, anonymity, plagiarism, or broader-impact compliance judgments, as the text does not contain the necessary disclosures or policy references.","paper_id":"H1fl8S9ee","paper_identity_sha256":"66d1297fbac7154efa0ccf839b5ce36a284040d18b7cde28e52540cc305af75f","prompt_identity_sha256":"3bc95bde15426f8ee57ebbabb93829a559ef1a98720bfea3bd1c417cd4cd34a3","raw_response_sha256":"9b52b76a7901a2dc010908847d4392ee49cebf12ba57316946b20ac35a1c85aa","request_identity_sha256":"8329d624592de32384ae6555c8b1c123e38e8e43b87569fd79f24eef494c2563","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"ede3a6569dad33afb5a799fe8188057d517db5713b1a14fbb7ad9528f8ffdb66","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-005","SRC-034"],"review_text":"The paper does not explicitly discuss ethical risks, fairness, or potential harms associated with the deployment of the proposed policy search algorithm. While the authors mention that exploration is restricted in industrial settings to avoid damage to the system, there is no broader discussion of safety, dual-use, or societal impact. The evidence provided does not support a determination of ethical compliance or the presence of specific ethical concerns.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-034","SRC-036"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes data from a real gas turbine and an industrial benchmark. It does not provide details regarding data consent, privacy regulations, or licensing terms for the industrial data used. The evidence is insufficient to determine whether the data usage complies with privacy or licensing policies.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper lists the authors' names and institutional affiliations (Siemens AG, Technical University of Munich, University of Cambridge, Harvard University) on the title page. Without a frozen venue-specific anonymity policy for the 2017 ICLR submission, it is not possible to declare this a violation or a clearance. The visible information is noted, but no policy judgment can be made based on the supplied evidence.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied evidence does not contain information regarding plagiarism, self-plagiarism, or dual submission. The absence of such evidence does not prove originality or the absence of misconduct. Therefore, the evidence is insufficient to make a determination on this subdimension.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-034"],"review_text":"The paper mentions that the code for the 'industrial benchmark' is publicly available, but it does not specify the software or data licenses used. There is no mention of IRB/ethics approvals or a broader-impact statement. The evidence is insufficient to determine compliance with policy-required documentation or broader-impact considerations.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"0855503548177671f640458f5de2b1926f2665360c5a85d668923069b48c8d8e","paper_id":"H1fl8S9ee","paper_ordinal":91,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"9b52b76a7901a2dc010908847d4392ee49cebf12ba57316946b20ac35a1c85aa","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"H1fl8S9ee","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"70d072f80d953a23345c1b61dabbb346a49712c0028b6e89c3891bfb441